mvn clean test => it clears the previous build results and
                 it will compile and runs all @Test classes in src/test/java
                 and for running the full suite.

mvn -version => to check the version of maven

mvn -Dtest=LoginTest test => run a specific Test Class and LoginTest=class name(no .java)
                            runs only LoginTest.java

mvn -Dtest=LoginTest#loginTest test => run specific method in a Test Class
                                        Format: ClassName#methodName

mvn clean test -DxmlSuiteFile=testing.xml  => command used to run the testng.xml file as well as running parallel tests.